        },
        {
          "type": "warning",
          "content": "- Grouping bits from the **left** — always group from the **right** and pad the left.\n- Reading division remainders **top down** — read them **bottom up**.\n- Writing 10 – 15 as two digits in hex (e.g. \"1 5\" for F).\n- Saying hex \"uses less memory\" or \"is faster for the computer\"."
        },
